<deviceset name="WE-SHCA_SMT-FRAME" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:54104248/1" prefix="H">
<description>WE-SHCA Shielding Cabinets

Characteristics
Customizable Product Series:
Dimensions
Shape (Cabi
Base material
Plating
Tin plate in accordance with DIN EN 10202/10203
Two-part case consisting of a solderable grid frame (SMT/THT) and a removable cover
Packaged in Tape &amp; Reel for easy pick &amp; place soldering

Applications
To prevent EMI radiation from PCB and to keep sensitivity low of:
– RF output stages
– RF input and amplifier stages
– Oscillators
– EMC sensitive parts in plastic cases

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-SHCA

Created by Ella 2026-10-14
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
<gates>
<gate name="G$1" symbol="WE-SHCA" x="0" y="0"/>
</gates>
